WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:07.990
Just 109 km from Podgorica and about 380 km from Belgrade

2
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:12.310
lies a true pearl of Montenegro — Piva Nature Park.

3
00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:17.030
Whichever way you turn, nature will leave you speechless,

4
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:22.990
and once you get out of the car and breathe deeply, you'll understand that you've come to the right place.

5
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:28.870
The freshness and aroma of various herbs everywhere around you simply overwhelm all the senses.

6
00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:34.050
All the members of our journalist team came here for the first time,

7
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:37.830
so we, as they say, opened both our eyes and our souls.

8
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.910
And thanks to a great guy, our guide Petar,

9
00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.910
getting to know Piva Nature Park was even more fun.

10
00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:53.610
At his initiative, as soon as we arrived, we set off to the ethno village, which is a leader of rural tourism here.

11
00:00:53.610 --> 00:01:00.010
On site, in a fantastic location, on the edge of the Piva Lake canyon in Rudinice,

12
00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:03.070
we were met by a cordial host, Mr. Novica,

13
00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:09.810
who told us when and how his family embarked on this business adventure.

14
00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:17.030
Almost 30 years ago my late father built a small rural kafana here, on this spot,

15
00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:21.130
which, you'll agree, is magnificent, with a beautiful view of Piva Lake.

16
00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:22.350
That's when it all began.

17
00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:27.590
Around 2007 we got the idea to make an ethno village, to use this location

18
00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:32.070
and build accommodation for tourists,

19
00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:37.850
and, of course, to use this fantastic nature so our guests could enjoy it to the fullest.

20
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:46.830
Our host admitted to us jokingly that since time immemorial the best ideas have been born in good company and over a glass of homemade drinks.

21
00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:50.730
And in their first little kafana, all sorts of things were dreamed up.

22
00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:57.710
And the best idea they had is precisely the one you see now: the "Izlazak" ethno village.

23
00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:02.170
And, to be honest, when I got the idea to build an ethno village, I didn't have even a hundred euros in my pocket.

24
00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:04.410
I had a good idea.

25
00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:09.370
I even thought that I'd build all this with the 10,000 credit I took.

26
00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:16.530
However, as the work unfolded and we realized more seriously the project we'd gotten into —

27
00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.710
and we'd already gotten into enough debt that there was no way back.

28
00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:23.290
We had to take bigger loans too.

29
00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:27.530
So we went through a hard period of creating the ethno village.

30
00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:33.090
We did a lot ourselves: my family, my sons and my wife.

31
00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:40.090
So through persistent family labor we reached today's level,

32
00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:44.870
where we have the capacity you see.

33
00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:49.950
Although it all started with one little kafana that was renovated and five bungalows,

34
00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.370
thanks to the selfless work of the Gogić family

35
00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:58.610
the number of buildings grew, and the business story in Rudinice developed.

36
00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:04.390
We have 11 accommodation units, there are those first five bungalows

37
00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:09.270
that we built, they've become dilapidated, and we plan to renovate them soon.

38
00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:14.450
Currently 11 cabins are operating, capacity is about 30,

39
00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:17.610
and with extra beds 40 sleeping places.

40
00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.830
We're working on expansion, the corona and the crisis got in our way a bit,

41
00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:27.550
and now isn't the best time for investments, but you had a chance to see:

42
00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:31.690
we care about comfort, again, convenience,

43
00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:36.290
and that these buildings fit authentically into the rural atmosphere.

44
00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.870
We make everything from natural materials: stone and wood.

45
00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.090
In the restaurant we serve excellent homemade food.

46
00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:46.350
Much of it we produce ourselves, we buy from our neighbors from the village

47
00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:49.390
and from surrounding villages in the Piva area.

48
00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:54.910
On our menu you'll see everything from pies, priganice, cheese, kaymak or skorup,

49
00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.110
as we call it here, to smoked meats,

50
00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:02.810
lamb, veal, kačamak, cicvara — all of these are our traditional dishes.

51
00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:09.390
We have a wider menu too, because the requests of the guests who come to us vary,

52
00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:13.490
so we try to adapt our cuisine to their needs.

53
00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:18.510
There are also guests with special diets,

54
00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:22.870
so our kitchen is ready for both kosher and halal,

55
00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:26.850
and we, of course, make sure the guests are satisfied

56
00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.890
and that what they eat and drink at our ethno village

57
00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:34.290
is homemade, high-quality and tasty, which, you'll agree, is the main thing.

58
00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:38.570
As for the gastronomic offering, we confirmed it ourselves.

59
00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:42.310
Smiles on faces and empty plates said it all.

60
00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:46.150
Given that there's nothing more to add here,

61
00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:51.930
we returned to a problem that weighs on many guests of rural tourism all over the Balkans.

62
00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:58.790
Namely: reading the reviews, you'll notice that many complain about a lack of amenities and hygiene.

63
00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.890
Here that's not the case, quite the opposite.

64
00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:05.110
And our hosts are very proud of that.

65
00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.630
We have to adapt the conditions to the modern tourist.

66
00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.950
You saw that our buildings are made on the outside of stone, of wood,

67
00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:16.190
that it fits into the ethno atmosphere,

68
00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:21.670
and inside the mattresses, beds and bedding are comfortable.

69
00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.670
We admit, they're a bit more expensive than others',

70
00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:29.010
but our guest, besides nature, needs hygiene, needs comfort,

71
00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.570
and you have to watch the quality of the furniture.

72
00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:36.550
You also see in our cabins that the bathrooms are excellently equipped,

73
00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:40.270
that the beds are wooden, but the mattresses are very comfortable,

74
00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:42.630
the bedding — that is, hygiene is looked after.

75
00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:48.150
These are the basics that must be provided

76
00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.050
so that our tourists are happier.

77
00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:54.590
And once you provide what's needed for a guest to feel at home,

78
00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:58.630
then you gladly introduce him to the incredible nature

79
00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:04.410
that surrounds this ethno village and which for our hosts is the most important business partner.

80
00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:06.870
We organize rafting on the Tara with partners,

81
00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:09.830
we also have boats for trips on Piva Lake,

82
00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:13.550
excellent places for mountain hikes, walks,

83
00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:17.230
for cycling, for biking, for motorcyclists,

84
00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:21.690
that is, everything that such a small area as Piva offers,

85
00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:27.870
is rare even in some countries much better known for rural tourism,

86
00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.750
such as Switzerland, Austria or Slovenia.

87
00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.530
As for nature, we're not behind,

88
00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:35.110
on the contrary, in a small area we're ahead of them,

89
00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:38.530
you just have to adapt these resources to the modern guest,

90
00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:41.550
so that he has full comfort, hygiene.

91
00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:44.350
We've also provided the ethno village with internet,

92
00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:46.670
taking into account the needs of modern society,

93
00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:51.730
so we take care that our guests enjoy this rural atmosphere,

94
00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.610
with good homemade food, in the nature that surrounds us,

95
00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:59.270
and at the same time have all the extras

96
00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:02.070
that are necessary for their lives

97
00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.770
in general at our ethno village.

98
00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:08.650
While our journalist team was filming the last shots,

99
00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.050
the village was literally alive.

100
00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.850
Guests began to arrive from all sides

101
00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.750
for lunch, and we asked Mr. Novica

102
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:18.330
when their season is.

103
00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.030
Our main tourist season begins already

104
00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.390
at the end of March — beginning of April.

105
00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.350
The first guests are bikers and cyclists.

106
00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:30.050
They usually stay overnight, two or three nights.

107
00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:34.050
From the end of May and until about the end of September

108
00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:39.370
come guests who stay for two or three nights and longer.

109
00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.910
We, except for 2020 and partly 2021,

110
00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.550
95% are foreign guests.

111
00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:58.990
They know well where they're going: they go to Montenegro, which is beautiful,

112
00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.350
from the sea to Durmitor is a 2-hour drive,

113
00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.090
the combination of this nature is incredible,

114
00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:07.190
so occupancy is excellent.

115
00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:11.930
Last season we were almost completely full

116
00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.230
for those roughly 5–6 months.

117
00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:17.250
From this season we expect it to be excellent,

118
00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.590
because judging by the requests and bookings we have,

119
00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:22.290
a lot is booked.

120
00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:25.870
We have foreign partners too, agencies we cooperate with,

121
00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:26.510
and local ones.

122
00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.930
They've already taken these dates.

123
00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.050
Their guests usually stay for 3–4 nights.

124
00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.830
During those 4–5 days they use all the possibilities

125
00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:37.530
offered by the additional program:

126
00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:40.670
rafting, a trip on the lake, kayaking, mountain hikes,

127
00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.290
canyoning on the Komarnica,

128
00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.150
so people know well where they're going

129
00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:46.970
and why they're going,

130
00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.210
and we try to use these natural resources

131
00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:54.070
and, of course, make sure the service is as it should be.

132
00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.290
Tourists are definitely well informed

133
00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.270
about where they're going and what to expect.

134
00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.710
That's why they always have a great time

135
00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.930
and, most importantly, come back regularly.

136
00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:06.310
And it's known that there's no better advertising

137
00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.710
than a satisfied guest.

138
00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:11.090
Considering that at the start of the report

139
00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:15.150
we stressed that this ethno village is a leader in rural tourism in Plužine,

140
00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:19.250
we were interested in what the secret of the Gogić family's way of doing business is,

141
00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:22.070
which others — those already in this business

142
00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:23.650
or planning to enter it —

143
00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.330
could adopt.

144
00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:30.450
For service in rural tourism in Montenegro to be complete,

145
00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:34.250
the key model is a family business.

146
00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.590
Our whole family is involved:

147
00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:38.270
my wife, two sons, daughter-in-law,

148
00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.950
and there are two grandchildren too, Milica and Pavle.

149
00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.530
The staff is also from Piva.

150
00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:49.610
Our sons and the waiters who work here speak English,

151
00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.770
understand Russian, a little Italian,

152
00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.130
so we've covered this part of the service too,

153
00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:58.450
so that communication with guests is at a high level.

154
00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:00.510
To be successful in business,

155
00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.010
we must watch every little detail,

156
00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:05.550
and you'll agree that life is made up of little things.

157
00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.170
We think you've heard everything,

158
00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.030
so now it's your turn.

159
00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.950
Give your loved ones

160
00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:15.250
an incredible holiday experience at the "Izlazak" ethno village.

161
00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:17.610
We're sure you'll remember for a long time

162
00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.910
and retell this adventure.

163
00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.750
And our journey has only just begun.

164
00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.170
In the next episode we'll show you

165
00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.130
what you can't miss

166
00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:29.590
when you come to Piva Nature Park.

167
00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.750
So stay with us!